+// FlashAttention-2 style forward kernel for BF16, D=128, sm_86 (Ampere).
+// - Q/K/V tiles staged in shared memory, 128-bit vectorized global loads.
+// - QK^T and PV via mma.sync.m16n8k16 tensor-core instructions.
+// - Online softmax in FP32 with deferred rescaling (FA2 style).
+// - Work partitioning: warp w owns Q rows [16*w, 16*w+16) within the block
+//   (BLOCK_M=64, 4 warps). Causal handled by skipping whole tiles and masking
+//   the diagonal tile.
+//
+// Fragment layouts (established empirically, see probe_layout.cu):
+//   mma m16n8k16: D lane l holds rows {l/4, l/4+8} x cols {2*(l%4), 2*(l%4)+1}
+//   A (Q) frag: 4x uint32 = rows {l/4, l/4+8}, cols {2*(l%4),2*(l%4)+1} and
+//                {2*(l%4)+8, 2*(l%4)+9}
+//   ldmatrix x4 without trans loads 4 consecutive 8x8 b16 matrices; lane
+//   groups of 8 address the rows.
